143 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In this project, I analyzed Pizza Hut sales using SQL. I started by finding the total number of orders and the total revenue from pizza sales. I also identified the most expensive pizza, the most popular pizza size, and the top 5 pizzas ordered. I looked at when orders were placed to see the most common hours and checked how many pizzas were ordered on average per day. I also figured out which 3 pizza types made the most money and how much each pizza type contributed to the total revenue. Finally, I broke down the revenue for different pizza categories and found the top 3 pizzas in each category based on revenue)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
